{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"35060","name":"Eurostars Monumental","description":"This city hotel is situated in the centre of Barcelona. It is an ideal starting point for exploring the city. There are scores of restaurants, bars, nightclubs and shops in the surrounding area(within 2km of the hotel). The transfer time to the airport takes around 30 minutes. The public transport network is easily reached on foot. It is 2km to the beach from the hotel. This hotel has a total of 45 rooms spread over 8 floors. There is also a lobby with a reception open 24 hours a day, cloakroom and lift, a café, a bar and a restaurant. Guests can also use an Internet terminal, a car park. The hotel offers a massage service. The rooms consist of an en suite bathroom, a hairdryer, direct dial telephone, satellite TV, Internet access, a minibar, a king-size bed, central heating and a hire safe.","address":"Carrer Del Consell De Cent, 500","city":"BARCELONA","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08013","lat":41.400592,"lng":2.178652,"stars":4,"chain":"EUROS","giataCode":"63774","phone":"0034932320288","email":"reservas@eurostarsmonumental.com","website":"www.eurostarsmonumental.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_l_011.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/03/035060/035060a_hb_l_006.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url